        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gates of fate have opened. Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/96b3ef0123da4f0d0b2b5767cc5dd9aa.poster.avif?t=1761457015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/96b3ef0123da4f0d0b2b5767cc5dd9aa.webm?t=1761457015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/96b3ef0123da4f0d0b2b5767cc5dd9aa.mp4?t=1761457015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As eras turn, destiny returns. The ancient seals binding the world are quietly unraveling, and primordial demons long slumbering in the abyss are breaking free from their shackles. Shadows spread as corrupted monsters howl at the borders, kingdoms tremble amidst turmoil, and an age of despair descends upon this vast continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey is fraught with peril, but combat is the pen with which you'll write your legend. In meticulously designed turn-based battles, strategy is the key to victory. You must discern enemy weaknesses, coordinate your party's classes and skills, and devise diverse tactics amidst flashing blades and cataclysmic magic to overcome increasingly powerful monsters and reclaim lands tainted by darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet combat is not all there is to this odyssey. Ancient ruins and lost texts scattered across the world await deciphering by true heroes. Every choice you make may unveil startling secrets buried by time, gradually revealing the ultimate truth about light and destruction behind this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, will you rekindle the flames of hope, or succumb to eternal oblivion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the world now rests in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into this enchanting fantasy RPG world! Here, you'll experience:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/e5aed0803e914af2ad3fba1c23ac4c6c.poster.avif?t=1761457015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/e5aed0803e914af2ad3fba1c23ac4c6c.webm?t=1761457015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/e5aed0803e914af2ad3fba1c23ac4c6c.mp4?t=1761457015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Classic turn-based combat: Devise strategies, employ diverse skills and magic to challenge formidable foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/fa4b6564d0aacf0e3d641f139c602e42.poster.avif?t=1761457015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/fa4b6564d0aacf0e3d641f139c602e42.webm?t=1761457015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/fa4b6564d0aacf0e3d641f139c602e42.mp4?t=1761457015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep camaraderie: Recruit unique companions, each with their own stories and growth arcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/75c715f76255e1613267081abd6cc777.poster.avif?t=1761457015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/75c715f76255e1613267081abd6cc777.webm?t=1761457015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/75c715f76255e1613267081abd6cc777.mp4?t=1761457015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An epic adventure: From peaceful villages to ancient ruins, explore a fantasy continent shrouded in darkness and uncover a saga of courage and sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gates of fate have opened. Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/96b3ef0123da4f0d0b2b5767cc5dd9aa.poster.avif?t=1761457015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/96b3ef0123da4f0d0b2b5767cc5dd9aa.webm?t=1761457015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/96b3ef0123da4f0d0b2b5767cc5dd9aa.mp4?t=1761457015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As eras turn, destiny returns. The ancient seals binding the world are quietly unraveling, and primordial demons long slumbering in the abyss are breaking free from their shackles. Shadows spread as corrupted monsters howl at the borders, kingdoms tremble amidst turmoil, and an age of despair descends upon this vast continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey is fraught with peril, but combat is the pen with which you'll write your legend. In meticulously designed turn-based battles, strategy is the key to victory. You must discern enemy weaknesses, coordinate your party's classes and skills, and devise diverse tactics amidst flashing blades and cataclysmic magic to overcome increasingly powerful monsters and reclaim lands tainted by darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet combat is not all there is to this odyssey. Ancient ruins and lost texts scattered across the world await deciphering by true heroes. Every choice you make may unveil startling secrets buried by time, gradually revealing the ultimate truth about light and destruction behind this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, will you rekindle the flames of hope, or succumb to eternal oblivion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the world now rests in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into this enchanting fantasy RPG world! Here, you'll experience:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/e5aed0803e914af2ad3fba1c23ac4c6c.poster.avif?t=1761457015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/e5aed0803e914af2ad3fba1c23ac4c6c.webm?t=1761457015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/e5aed0803e914af2ad3fba1c23ac4c6c.mp4?t=1761457015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Classic turn-based combat: Devise strategies, employ diverse skills and magic to challenge formidable foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/fa4b6564d0aacf0e3d641f139c602e42.poster.avif?t=1761457015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/fa4b6564d0aacf0e3d641f139c602e42.webm?t=1761457015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/fa4b6564d0aacf0e3d641f139c602e42.mp4?t=1761457015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep camaraderie: Recruit unique companions, each with their own stories and growth arcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/75c715f76255e1613267081abd6cc777.poster.avif?t=1761457015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/75c715f76255e1613267081abd6cc777.webm?t=1761457015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062330/extras/75c715f76255e1613267081abd6cc777.mp4?t=1761457015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An epic adventure: From peaceful villages to ancient ruins, explore a fantasy continent shrouded in darkness and uncover a saga of courage and sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
